        "sendTo": "bhatsabiq9@gmail.com",
        "subject": "=[APPROVAL] {{ $('Build Context').item.json.ticket_number }} — {{ $('Build Context').item.json.subject }}",
        "message": "=<h2>Ticket {{ $('Build Context').item.json.ticket_number }}</h2>\n<p><b>From:</b> {{ $('Build Context').item.json.customer_name }} &lt;{{ $('Build Context').item.json.customer_email }}&gt;<br>\n<b>AI confidence:</b> {{ $('Draft Reply').item.json.output.confidence }} &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Top retrieval score:</b> {{ $('Build Context').item.json.top_score }}</p>\n\n<h3>Customer wrote</h3>\n<pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;background:#f6f6f6;padding:10px\">{{ $('Build Context').item.json.body_text }}</pre>\n\n<h3>Issue summary</h3>\n<p>{{ $('Draft Reply').item.json.output.issue_summary }}</p>\n\n<h3>Suggested resolution (internal)</h3>\n<p>{{ $('Draft Reply').item.json.output.suggested_resolution }}</p>\n\n<h3>Sources retrieved</h3>\n<pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;background:#f6f6f6;padding:10px;font-size:12px\">{{ $('Build Context').item.json.context_block }}</pre>\n\n<h3>Proposed reply to customer</h3>\n<pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;background:#eef7ee;padding:10px\">{{ $('Draft Reply').item.json.output.customer_reply }}</pre>\n\n<p>Approve, or paste an edited version in the form below.</p>",
